    },
    {
      "text": "\n### Shuffle partition\n\n\n 1. data per shuffle partitions is large\n 2. data per shuffle partitions is less",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
