      "id": "f040e4803a62479a8d943"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n###machine config\n - 5 node\n - 48 gb ram\n - 12 core \n\n1. \n  - 1gb and 1 core for hadoop/yarn/os,so below per node\n      47GB\n      11core\n\n2. \n   -  Total memory: 47 * 5 = 235 GB\n   -  Total Core: 11 * 5 = 55 \n\n3.\n   -  suppose we want 5 core per executor\n   \n   - so,  total executor = 55/5 = 11 executor\n\n4. leave out 1 core and 1 gb for AM\n   remaining\n         - 10 executor and total 234 Gb Memory\n      \n5. acutial memory per executor\n  - 234/10 = 13.4 gb per executor\n  - counting of (spark.yarn.executor.memory.overhead): MAX of (384 or 0.7 % of spark.executor.memory)\n  - 23.4*(1-0.7) ~=  16.4 GB per executor\n\n\n  so finally\n  ```\n   spark.executor.instance=10\n   spark.executor.memory=16.4\n   spark.driver.memory=20GB\n   spark.memory.storageFraction=0.3\n   spark.memory.fraction=0.9\n   spark.yarn.executor.memory.overhead=0.7\n\n  ```\n",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "0fb022f62e024351ba45e"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n### Spark Executor Tuning\n\n\n1.  hadoop/yarn/os :  Leave out 1 core, 1 GB RAM\n2.  memory overhead :  max(384, 10% of spark.executor.memory)\n3. hdfs throughput  : 3 to 5 per executor\n4. yarn applicaitonmaster(AM) : leave out 1 core and 1 gb RAM",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "a1db1c62dbc14af4b22e7"
    },
